      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE NAKED ART (5) had been competitive in Victoria including a Melton win back in August and was good when switching to Tasmania last start, racing parked and sticking on for second at Launceston, just 1.7 metres from the winner. Has won at this distance before and finds a suitable assignment. MUZZAME MATE (4) worked but kept kicking only to find one better last time out at Launceston, beaten 2.4m into second. That continued a run of consistent form. Leading hope. SNOWIEWILLREV (1) returns from a spell of ten weeks but won the last time he raced here two back, taking his record at this venue to four from six. Races well fresh and gets the ace draw. ATOMIC BLACK (12) won twice in a row before a last-start third at Launceston. Kept up to the mark with two trial placings since. Go well.",
